{
  "source": "Transcribed from peerjs@1.5.5 dist/bundler.mjs: Negotiator._makeOffer (data connection; metadata undefined, so JSON.stringify drops it), Negotiator._makeAnswer, Negotiator._setupListeners onicecandidate; Socket.send serializes {type, payload, dst}. Placeholders in <angle brackets> stand for per-run values. The candidate omits usernameFragment, which a browser's RTCIceCandidate.toJSON adds and PeerJS forwards untouched.",
